  data:
    Id: placeholder_brawler_slam
    DisplayName: Slam
    Description: Placeholder kit. He crosses the ground, gets the hammer over his
      head, and puts it through whatever is under it. Below 50 Fury it lands as a
      normal blow; at 50 or more it spends half his Fury for double damage; at 100
      it spends it all for quadruple damage. He always throws the hardest hit he
      can afford.
